Build systems for:

Annual IRS filings, such as Form 990, 990-EZ, 990-N, or other applicable returns

State annual reports and charitable-registration renewals

Payroll taxes and employment filings, if you hire staff

Grant reporting

Donation receipts and acknowledgments

Records retention

Public disclosure obligations

For U.S. donors claiming deductions of $250 or more, a contemporaneous written acknowledgment is generally required; it must address whether goods or services were provided in exchange for the gift. 
